1181-#### Export
1182-
1183-The `export` setting causes all `just` variables to be exported as environment
1184-variables. Defaults to `false`.
1185-
1186-```just
1187-set export
1188-
1189-a := "hello"
1190-
1191-@foo b:
1192-  echo $a
1193-  echo $b
1194-```
1195-
1196-```console
1197-$ just foo goodbye
1198-hello
1199-goodbye
1200-```
1201-
1202-#### Lazy
1203-
1204-The `lazy` setting<sup>1.47.0</sup> causes the evaluator to skip evaluating
1205-unused variables. This can be beneficial when a `justfile` contains variables
1206-that are expensive to evaluate but only sometimes used.
