2732:### Getting and Setting Environment Variables
2733-
2734-#### Exporting `just` Variables
2735-
2736-Assignments prefixed with the `export` keyword will be exported to recipes as
2737-environment variables:
2738-
2739-```just
2740-export RUST_BACKTRACE := "1"
2741-
2742-test:
2743-  # will print a stack trace if it crashes
2744-  cargo test
2745-```
2746-
2747-Parameters prefixed with a `$` will be exported as environment variables:
2748-
2749-```just
2750-test $RUST_BACKTRACE="1":
2751-  # will print a stack trace if it crashes
2752-  cargo test
2753-```
